-holder>Cancer Research UK</copyright-holder></permissions></article-meta></front><body><p><bold>Correction to</bold>: British Journal of Cancer (2008) 99, 1874&#x02013;1883; doi:<related-article related-article-type="corrected-article" id="N0x33b0c70N0x3b61610" ext-link-type="doi" xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink" xlink:href="10.1038/sj.bjc.6604740">10.1038/sj.bjc.6604740</related-article></p><p>During final submission of this paper, the authors very regretfully failed to acknowledge some of the support given to them during the completion of their study. Their full and complete Acknowledgments are given below:</p></body><back><ack><p>The excellent technical assistance of Bernadette Bournonville and Chantal Degraef is greatly appreciated. The kind help of Dani&#x000e8;le Leemans-De Vos for secretarial task is also acknowledged. This work was supported by Fondation Van Buuren; Fondation Tournay-Solvay; GENERISK-T: Genetic component of the low dose risk of thyroid cancer; FRSM: Fonds Recherche Scientifique M&#x000e9;dicale; ARC: Actions de Recherche Concert&#x000e9;es de la Communaut&#x000e9; Francaise de Belgique.</p></ack></back></article>